msgstr "(c) 2026 Miryu"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Manage Miryu components, maintenance tasks, system-wide environment "
"variables and sleep settings in one place."
msgstr "集中管理 Miryu 组件、维护任务、系统范围环境变量和睡眠设置。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:91 src/mainwindow.cpp:187
msgid "Miryu System Assistant"
msgstr "Miryu 系统助手"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:92 src/mainwindow.cpp:1757
msgid "Boot Menu"
msgstr "启动菜单"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:93
msgid "System-wide environment variables"
msgstr "系统范围环境变量"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:94
msgid "Sleep"
msgstr "睡眠"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:95
msgid "Install additional components"
msgstr "安装额外组件"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:96
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:100
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "准备完成"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:121
msgid "Install Fedora official kernel"
msgstr "安装 Fedora 官方内核"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:122
msgid ""
"If some games' anti-cheat systems use Epic EAC Linux v2 and cannot start, "
"you can install the Fedora official kernel to solve the problem."
msgstr "如果某些游戏的反作弊系统使用了 Epic EAC Linux v2 而无法启动，那么可以安装 Fedora 官方内核以解决该问题。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:135
msgid "Install Wine"
msgstr "安装 Wine"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Install Wine, DXVK, Winetricks and WineASIO for running Windows programs and"
" some audio workflows."
msgstr "安装 Wine、DXVK、Winetricks 和 WineASIO，用于运行 Windows 程序和部分音频工作流。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:149
msgid "Install Steam"
msgstr "安装 Steam"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:150
msgid ""
"Install the Steam client. Steam will download update files on first launch."
msgstr "安装 Steam 客户端。首次启动时 Steam 会下载更新文件。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:157
msgid "Install MIDI playback support"
msgstr "安装 MIDI 播放支持"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Install the FluidSynth GStreamer plugin to enable MIDI file playback "
"support."
msgstr "安装 FluidSynth GStreamer 插件，以启用 MIDI 文件播放支持。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:165
msgid "Install additional fonts"
msgstr "安装补充字体"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:166
msgid ""
"Install Noto Sans, Noto Serif, monospace and CJK supplemental fonts to "
"improve multilingual display."
msgstr "安装 Noto Sans、Noto Serif、等宽和 CJK 补充字体，以改善多语言显示。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:191 src/mainwindow.cpp:2466
msgid "Clean up previous kernel"
msgstr "清理上一版本内核"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:196 src/mainwindow.cpp:2846
msgid "Update system"
msgstr "更新系统"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:201
msgid "List failed systemd service units"
msgstr "列出 systemd 失败的服务单元"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:206 src/mainwindow.cpp:3133
msgid "Unlock RPM database"
msgstr "解锁 RPM 数据库"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:211
msgid "View dnf5 log"
msgstr "查看 dnf5 日志"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:216
msgid "Clean unused packages (dnf5 autoremove)"
msgstr "清理无用的软件包（dnf5 autoremove）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:221
msgid "View software crash information"
msgstr "查看软件崩溃信息"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:226
msgid "Collect system logs"
msgstr "收集系统日志"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:244
msgid "Additional components"
msgstr "额外组件"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:252
msgid "Refresh status"
msgstr "刷新状态"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:277
msgid "Status: checking"
msgstr "状态：检查中"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:287
msgid "Packages: %1"
msgstr "软件包：%1"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:294 src/mainwindow.cpp:1621
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:295 src/mainwindow.cpp:1621
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:320
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:323
msgid ""
"Set system-wide environment variables using the NAME=VALUE format. Changes "
"are written to /etc/environment and take effect after logging in again."
msgstr "使用 NAME=VALUE 格式设置系统范围环境变量。修改会写入 /etc/environment，并在重新登录后生效。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:333 src/mainwindow.cpp:1818
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:335
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "重新读取"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:336 src/mainwindow.cpp:2363 src/mainwindow.cpp:2364
msgid "Restore defaults"
msgstr "恢复默认"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:337
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:347
msgid "Log out and log back in for changes to take effect."
msgstr "注销并重新登录后更改生效。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:431
msgid "Allowed sleep modes"
msgstr "允许的睡眠模式"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:435
msgid "Choose the sleep modes you want to allow."
msgstr "选择你想要允许的睡眠模式。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:460 src/mainwindow.cpp:850 src/mainwindow.cpp:860
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:863 src/mainwindow.cpp:1346
msgid "Suspend"
msgstr "挂起"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:461
msgid ""
"Keeps the session in memory (RAM). The computer is still running but uses "
"only a bit of power."
msgstr "将会话保留在内存（RAM）中。计算机仍在运行，但只消耗少量电量。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:464 src/mainwindow.cpp:1349
msgid "Hibernate"
msgstr "休眠"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:465
msgid "Saves the session to disk (Swap). Shuts down the computer."
msgstr "将会话保存到磁盘（交换分区）。计算机会关机。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:468
msgid "Suspend then hibernate"
msgstr "挂起后休眠"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:469
msgid ""
"Suspends for a while (systemd decides how long, based on battery power), "
"then hibernates."
msgstr "挂起一段时间（systemd 根据电池电量决定时长），然后休眠。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:472
msgid "Hybrid sleep"
msgstr "混合睡眠"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:473
msgid "Suspends but also saves the session to disk (Swap)."
msgstr "挂起的同时也将会话保存到磁盘（交换分区）。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:479
msgid "Suspend method"
msgstr "挂起方法"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:482
msgid ""
"This is the method used to suspend the computer. Only the methods offered by"
" your BIOS/firmware can be chosen."
msgstr "这是用于挂起计算机的方法。只能选择你的 BIOS/固件提供的方法。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:496
msgid "Hibernation method"
msgstr "休眠方法"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:499
msgid "This is the method used to power off the computer during hibernation."
msgstr "这是在休眠期间关闭计算机电源所使用的方法。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:513
msgid "Hibernation image compressor"
msgstr "休眠镜像压缩"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:516
msgid ""
"The algorithm used to compress the hibernation image. The kernel must have "
"the corresponding compression support built in; algorithms that are not "
"available are greyed out."
msgstr "用于压缩休眠镜像的算法。内核必须内置相应的压缩支持；不可用的算法将显示为灰色。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:530
msgid "Detected problems"
msgstr "检测到的问题"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:532
msgid "Fix the detected problems to make your allowed sleep modes available."
msgstr "修复检测到的问题，使你允许的睡眠模式可用。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:542 src/mainwindow.cpp:1461 src/mainwindow.cpp:1482
msgid "Fix detected problems"
msgstr "修复检测到的问题"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:551
msgid "Available sleep modes"
msgstr "可用睡眠模式"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:553
msgid "These are the sleep modes systemd reports as available right now."
msgstr "这些是 systemd 当前报告为可用的睡眠模式。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:566 src/mainwindow.cpp:1857
msgid "Saving requires administrator authentication through polkit."
msgstr "保存需要通过 polkit 进行管理员身份验证。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:568
msgid "Apply sleep settings"
msgstr "应用睡眠设置"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:617 src/mainwindow.cpp:653
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:628 src/mainwindow.cpp:854
msgid "Suspend-to-idle (s2idle)"
msgstr "挂起到空闲（s2idle）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:630 src/mainwindow.cpp:856
msgid "Suspend-to-RAM (S3)"
msgstr "挂起到内存（S3）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:632 src/mainwindow.cpp:858
msgid "Shallow (S1)"
msgstr "浅度（S1）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:641 src/mainwindow.cpp:675
msgid "Default — %1"
msgstr "默认 — %1"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:664
msgid "Platform (the firmware powers off)"
msgstr "平台（由固件关机）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:666
msgid "Shutdown (the kernel powers off)"
msgstr "关机（由内核关机）"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:714
msgid "Default — LZ4"
msgstr "默认 — LZ4"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:716
msgid "Default — LZO"
msgstr "默认 — LZO"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:718
msgid "Default — none available"
msgstr "默认 — 均不可用"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:850
msgid "The kernel supports suspend."
msgstr "内核支持挂起。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:860
msgid "The kernel supports suspend. Method in use: %1."
msgstr "内核支持挂起。当前使用的方法：%1。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:863
msgid "The kernel does not support suspend."
msgstr "内核不支持挂起。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:872 src/mainwindow.cpp:874
msgid "Kernel support"
msgstr "内核支持"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:872
msgid "The kernel supports hibernation."
msgstr "内核支持休眠。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:874
msgid "The kernel does not support hibernation."
msgstr "内核不支持休眠。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:904 src/mainwindow.cpp:906 src/mainwindow.cpp:908
msgid "Secure Boot"
msgstr "安全启动"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:904
msgid "Secure Boot is enabled and the kernel lockdown prevents hibernation."
msgstr "安全启动已启用，内核锁定会阻止休眠。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:906
msgid "Secure Boot is enabled but the kernel lockdown is not active."
msgstr "安全启动已启用，但内核锁定未激活。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:908
msgid "Secure Boot is disabled."
msgstr "安全启动已禁用。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:986
msgid "Swap"
msgstr "交换"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:986
msgid "No swap partition or swap file is in use."
msgstr "当前没有使用任何交换分区或交换文件。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:990
msgid "Swap area in %1"
msgstr "%1 中的交换区域"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:994
msgid "The swap area (%1) is smaller than the memory (%2)."
msgstr "交换区域（%1）小于内存（%2）。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:997
msgid "The swap area (%1) is at least as large as the memory (%2)."
msgstr "交换区域（%1）至少与内存（%2）一样大。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1027 src/mainwindow.cpp:1032
msgid "Swap priority"
msgstr "交换区优先级"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1028
msgid ""
"A zram device (priority %1) outranks the swap file (priority %2); "
"hibernation may fail with \"device or resource busy\"."
msgstr "zram 设备（优先级 %1）高于交换文件（优先级 %2）；休眠可能因\"设备或资源忙\"而失败。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1033
msgid "The swap file has the highest swap priority (%1)."
msgstr "交换文件具有最高交换优先级（%1）。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1071 src/mainwindow.cpp:1080 src/mainwindow.cpp:1083
msgid "Hibernation compression"
msgstr "休眠压缩"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1072
msgid ""
"Neither the lzo nor the lz4 hibernation compressor is available in the "
"kernel; hibernation fails with \"Operation not supported\"."
msgstr "内核中既没有 lzo 也没有 lz4 休眠压缩算法；休眠会因\"不支持的操作\"而失败。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1081
msgid "The hibernation compressor %1 is available."
msgstr "休眠压缩算法 %1 可用。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1084
msgid ""
"The configured compressor %1 is not available; select %2 in the compressor "
"list above."
msgstr "配置的压缩算法 %1 不可用；请在上方的压缩算法列表中选择 %2。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1103 src/mainwindow.cpp:1108
msgid "Hyper-V devices"
msgstr "Hyper-V 设备"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1104
msgid ""
"The uio_hv_generic driver is bound to %1 VMBus device(s) and has no suspend "
"support, which aborts hibernation."
msgstr "uio_hv_generic 驱动绑定了 %1 个 VMBus 设备且不支持挂起，会导致休眠中止。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1109
msgid "No VMBus device is bound to uio_hv_generic."
msgstr "没有 VMBus 设备绑定到 uio_hv_generic。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1128 src/mainwindow.cpp:1132
msgid "VMware graphics"
msgstr "VMware 显卡"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1129
msgid ""
"The vmwgfx driver refuses to freeze while a graphical session holds a DRM "
"context, which aborts hibernation."
msgstr "图形会话持有 DRM 上下文时，vmwgfx 驱动拒绝冻结，会导致休眠中止。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1133
msgid "The vmwgfx driver will be released during hibernation."
msgstr "休眠期间将释放 vmwgfx 驱动。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1153
msgid "Hibernation drivers"
msgstr "休眠驱动"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1154
msgid ""
"%1 driver(s) abort the freezer and are detached while the image is written: "
"%2"
msgstr "%1 个驱动会中止冻结，写入镜像期间将被解绑：%2"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1162
msgid "Last hibernation"
msgstr "上次休眠"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1163
msgid ""
"The previous hibernation attempt failed; the failing driver can be released "
"automatically."
msgstr "上次休眠失败；导致失败的驱动可被自动释放。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1181 src/mainwindow.cpp:1199 src/mainwindow.cpp:1204
msgid "Resume device"
msgstr "恢复设备"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1181
msgid "No resume device is set."
msgstr "未设置恢复设备。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1200
msgid ""
"The resume device (%1:%2) does not match any swap partition or swap file in "
"use."
msgstr "恢复设备（%1:%2）与当前使用的任何交换分区或交换文件都不匹配。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1205
msgid "The resume device is set to %1."
msgstr "恢复设备已设置为 %1。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1228 src/mainwindow.cpp:1233 src/mainwindow.cpp:1251
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1256 src/mainwindow.cpp:1270 src/mainwindow.cpp:1274
msgid "SELinux"
msgstr "SELinux"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1229
msgid ""
"The swap file %1 is not labeled with swapfile_t; hibernation may be denied "
"under SELinux enforcing mode."
msgstr "交换文件 %1 未标记为 swapfile_t；在 SELinux 强制模式下休眠可能被拒绝。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1234
msgid "The swap file %1 is correctly labeled with swapfile_t."
msgstr "交换文件 %1 已正确标记为 swapfile_t。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1252
msgid ""
"The swap directory %1 has an SELinux context that systemd-logind cannot "
"search."
msgstr "交换目录 %1 的 SELinux 上下文不允许 systemd-logind 搜索。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1257
msgid "The swap directory %1 has a searchable SELinux context."
msgstr "交换目录 %1 具有可搜索的 SELinux 上下文。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1271
msgid ""
"The SELinux boolean domain_kernel_dump is off; hibernation to swap is not "
"permitted."
msgstr "SELinux 布尔值 domain_kernel_dump 未开启；不允许向交换区执行休眠。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1275
msgid "The SELinux boolean domain_kernel_dump is on."
msgstr "SELinux 布尔值 domain_kernel_dump 已开启。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1288
msgid "No problems detected"
msgstr "未检测到问题"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1288
msgid "This computer looks ready for the sleep modes above."
msgstr "这台计算机看起来已为上述睡眠模式做好准备。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1353
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1393 src/mainwindow.cpp:2307
msgid "Unable to create a temporary file."
msgstr "无法创建临时文件。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1393 src/mainwindow.cpp:1420 src/mainwindow.cpp:1431
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:2307 src/mainwindow.cpp:2335 src/mainwindow.cpp:2346
msgid "Apply failed"
msgstr "应用失败"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1413
msgid "Sleep settings saved. Reboot for the changes to take full effect."
msgstr "睡眠设置已保存。重启后更改将完全生效。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1415
msgid ""
"Sleep settings have been saved. Reboot for the changes to take full effect."
msgstr "睡眠设置已保存。重启后更改将完全生效。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1416 src/mainwindow.cpp:2331
msgid "Apply completed"
msgstr "应用完成"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1419
msgid ""
"Saving sleep settings failed.\n"
"\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"保存睡眠设置失败。\n"
"\n"
"%1"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1430 src/mainwindow.cpp:1485 src/mainwindow.cpp:1724
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1728 src/mainwindow.cpp:2148 src/mainwindow.cpp:2345
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:2395 src/mainwindow.cpp:2578 src/mainwindow.cpp:2581
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:2709 src/mainwindow.cpp:2712 src/mainwindow.cpp:2916
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:2919 src/mainwindow.cpp:3040 src/mainwindow.cpp:3043
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:3179 src/mainwindow.cpp:3302 src/mainwindow.cpp:3305
#: src/mainwindow.cpp:3381
msgid ""
"Unable to start pkexec. Make sure polkit is installed and run this program "
"from a graphical session."
msgstr "无法启动 pkexec。请确认系统已安装 polkit，并从图形会话运行本程序。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1448
msgid "Fixing…"
msgstr "正在修复…"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1467
msgid ""
"The detected problems have been fixed. Reboot for the changes to take full "
"effect."
msgstr "检测到的问题已修复。重启后更改将完全生效。"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1468
msgid "Fix completed"
msgstr "修复完成"

#: src/mainwindow.cpp:1472
msgid ""
"Failed to fix the detected problems.\n"
"\n"
"%1"
